WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.875
Your turn.

2
00:00:01.155 --> 00:00:15.107
You now have the pieces: embeddings and similarity (week 1), ingestion and chunking (week 2), hybrid search and reranking (week 3), and grounded, verified answers with designed failure behavior (week 4).

3
00:00:15.387 --> 00:00:23.813
The Studio 2 project asks you to assemble them over a real corpus, make the decisions this lesson left open, and defend them with numbers.

4
00:00:24.093 --> 00:00:25.501
Start with the eval set.

5
00:00:25.781 --> 00:00:32.160
Build the thinnest end-to-end version next, measure it, and only then improve the stage your measurements point at.
